</style></head><body><main>
<header class="study-head"><span class="label">Communitygeeks / motif study 01</span><a href="#overview">See overview scale ↓</a></header>
<p class="intro">A working system, with a human checking the consequential decision. The constellation is a spatial loop around the astronaut: distant connections behind the disc, sharper nodes crossing the foreground.</p>
<div class="label">01 / Article scale</div>
<section class="article"><div><div class="label">Field note · Observation · 11 Sep 2026</div><h1>Building with AI coding agents: what still needs human judgment</h1><p class="deck">A recruiting workflow built with AI coding agents shows what becomes easier to create, and why problem framing, verification and oversight still matter.</p><div class="foot">AI Coding Agents &nbsp; / &nbsp; Systems Thinking &nbsp; / &nbsp; Human Judgment</div></div><aside class="aside"><div class="motif"></div><p class="question">What becomes more valuable when the distance between an idea and an executable system collapses?</p></aside></section>
<section class="overview" id="overview"><div class="label">02 / Overview card scale</div><article class="card"><div><div class="label">Article · Observation</div><h2>Building with AI coding agents: what still needs human judgment</h2><p>A recruiting workflow built with AI coding agents shows what becomes easier to create, and why problem framing, verification and oversight still matter.</p><div class="foot">11 Sep 2026 &nbsp; · &nbsp; Read article →</div></div><div class="motif"></div></article><p class="note">One concept at two sizes. The coral node is the review point; the astronaut’s scanner is aimed at it. The orbit carries the repeatable workflow around the human, with a visible front and back. Move the pointer over either illustration for a small depth shift.</p></section>
</main><script>
const f=n=>n.toFixed(2),point=(a,r=210)=>{const x=r*Math.cos(a),y=86*Math.sin(a);return [250+x*.94-y*.342,248+x*.342+y*.94]},coord=p=>p.map(f).join(',');
const arc=(start,end)=>Array.from({length:61},(_,i)=>point(start+(end-start)*i/60));
const path=points=>'M'+points.map(coord).join(' L');
const nodes=Array.from({length:14},(_,i)=>point(i*Math.PI/7));
const half=front=>{const pts=arc(front?0:Math.PI,front?Math.PI:2*Math.PI);let s=`<path d="${path(pts)}" fill="none" stroke="${front?'#71958f':'#8aa6a0'}" stroke-width="${front?1.5:1}" opacity="${front?.9:.45}"/>`;nodes.forEach((p,i)=>{if((i<7)!==front)return;const q=point(i*Math.PI/7,182);s+=`<path d="M${coord(p)}L${coord(q)}L${coord(nodes[(i+1)%14])}" fill="none" stroke="${front?'#789c95':'#9aafa7'}" opacity="${front?.55:.3}" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="${f(p[0])}" cy="${f(p[1])}" r="${front?3.2:2}" fill="${front?'#e9d9ac':'#89a39a'}" stroke="#658a83" stroke-width=".6"/>`});return s};
document.querySelectorAll('.motif').forEach((el,i)=>{el.innerHTML=`<svg class="art" viewBox="0 0 500 490" role="img" aria-label="An astronaut inspects a coral decision node in a constellation workflow that passes behind and in front of a petrol disc."><defs><radialGradient id="disc${i}" cx="35%" cy="25%" r="85%"><stop stop-color="#285455"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#092b30"/></radialGradient><linearGradient id="beam${i}" x1="1" y1="1" x2="0" y2="0"><stop stop-color="#ec765d" stop-opacity=".02"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#ec765d" stop-opacity=".22"/></linearGradient></defs><g class="depth">${half(false)}<circle cx="250" cy="248" r="146" fill="url(#disc${i})"/><circle cx="250" cy="248" r="146" fill="none" stroke="#70908a" stroke-width=".8"/><g stroke="#afc7b4" opacity=".17" fill="none"><path d="M136 191L177 134L237 109M333 369L364 306L386 233"/><circle cx="177" cy="134" r="2"/><circle cx="364" cy="306" r="2"/></g><image href="/assets/images/crew-rear-projection/inspect.webp" x="133" y="81" width="284" height="284"/><path class="scan" d="M174 115L103 78L92 105Z" fill="url(#beam${i})"/><path d="M98 91L65 161L94 213" fill="none" stroke="#849e91" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="65" cy="161" r="2.7" fill="#a4b6a5"/><circle cx="98" cy="91" r="15" fill="#f7f5ef" stroke="#ec765d" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M98 68V74M98 108V114M75 91H81M115 91H121" stroke="#ec765d" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="94" y="87" width="8" height="8" fill="#ec765d"/>${half(true)}</g></svg>`;if(!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches){el.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{const r=el.getBoundingClientRect(),x=(e.clientX-r.left)/r.width-.5,y=(e.clientY-r.top)/r.height-.5;el.querySelector('.depth').setAttribute('transform',`translate(${x*7} ${y*5})`)});el.addEventListener('pointerleave',()=>el.querySelector('.depth').removeAttribute('transform'))}});
</script></body></html>
